WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.210
Hi, Anna.

2
00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.290
Hi, Ashley.

3
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.410
Where are you going?

4
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.750
I am going to see a Nationals baseball game!

5
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.590
What time is the game?

6
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:09.590
Seven o'clock.

7
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.250
Do you have a ticket?

8
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:12.630
No, not yet.

9
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.590
Anna, you should go a lot earlier than seven o'clock.

10
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.690
That is why I'm taking a taxi.

11
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:20.650
Taxi!

12
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.870
Anna, that is not a good idea.

13
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.510
A bicycle is faster than a taxi.

14
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.150
Oh, Ashley.

15
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.390
Ashley, Ashley, Ashley.

16
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.250
A car is faster than your bicycle.

17
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:40.970
In DC traffic, sometimes a bicycle is faster than a car.

18
00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.090
And right now, there is a lot of traffic.

19
00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:44.870
Good point.

20
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.070
But I don't have a bicycle.

21
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.770
Okay, Anna, you can use my bicycle.

22
00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:58.570
Thanks!

23
00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.290
I really want to learn how to ride one.

24
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:08.190
Well, what do you mean learn how to ride a bike?

25
00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:10.230
Oh, Anna, Anna.

26
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:25.530
You know, Anna, the Metro is faster than a taxi and a bicycle.

27
00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.790
You want to take the Metro.

28
00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.390
It's that way.

29
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:30.970
Good idea.

30
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.150
Okay, see you later.

31
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.170
Bye, Anna.

32
00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:34.750
Bye.

33
00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.410
You should go a lot earlier than seven o'clock.

34
00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.490
The Metro was a lot faster than a bus, taxi, or bike.

35
00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.370
And now, I'm at National Park.

36
00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.050
Look at all these fans.

37
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.110
So many people like to watch baseball.

38
00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.390
There's the ticket window.

39
00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:24.690
What?

40
00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.690
The tickets are sold out.

41
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.410
No!

42
00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:32.990
No!

43
00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.430
But I really want to watch a baseball game.

44
00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.850
Does anybody have an extra ticket?

45
00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.490
Next time, you should buy your ticket online.

46
00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:51.470
Thanks.

47
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.050
Thanks a lot.

48
00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.530
It is good advice.

49
00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.650
Being early is better than being late.

50
00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:02.170
Until next time.
